<details class="install-help">
    <summary>Install Yap on your phone</summary>
    <p><strong>iPhone or iPad:</strong> Open Yap in Safari, tap Share, then Add to Home Screen. Keep Open as Web App enabled if shown.</p>
    <p><strong>Android:</strong> Open Yap in Chrome, open the browser menu, then tap Install app or Add to Home screen.</p>
    <p>Open Yap from its home-screen icon. An internet connection is required.</p>
</details>
